# The build context of orchestration/docker/Dockerfile is the repository root. Docker (BuildKit) reads THIS file -
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore, next to the Dockerfile - instead of the root .dockerignore. It is an allow-list:
# only the packages the image installs and the source folders it ships are sent (never .git, .venv, warehouse/, runs/,
# secrets files, untracked notes or sample data).
*

!streamwright
!connectors/ads/google_ads
!connectors/ads/microsoft_ads
!connectors/ads/facebook_ads
!connectors/readers/files
!connectors/readers/s3
!connectors/readers/gcs
!connectors/readers/postgres
!examples/sources

# ... and nothing generated inside them
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/dist
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
**/warehouse
**/runs
**/*.duckdb
**/*.duckdb.wal
connectors/*/*/tests
